\par
\b 17. Verification Steps\b0\par
After the system is running, use these checks:\par
1. Confirm the app loads at localhost:3000.\par
2. Confirm login works.\par
3. Confirm dashboard data loads.\par
4. Confirm planner and operator pages open.\par
5. Confirm API-backed pages return live data.\par
6. Confirm one complete record can move through production and quality flow.\par
