\par
\b 19. Troubleshooting\b0\par
1. If dependencies are missing, run npm install again.\par
2. If Prisma client is out of date, run npx prisma generate.\par
3. If schema and database are out of sync, run npx prisma db push.\par
4. If seed data is missing, run npx prisma db seed.\par
5. If the dev server fails, stop it and rerun npm run dev.\par
\par
